# `npm version <patch|minor|major>` bumps package.json, commits, and tags in one
# step — but tags `v0.3.1` by default, while publish-cli.yml triggers on `cli-v*`
# and refuses to run if the tag and package.json disagree.
#
# Setting the prefix here makes the whole release one command:
#   npm version minor && git push --follow-tags
#
# Not published: `files` in package.json limits the tarball to dist + docs.
tag-version-prefix=cli-v
